        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Achun sina bamzing lakge,",
            "Kandih piru zauruan tatna;",
            "Kabam kathuih zinghmei ruin a,",
            "Achaeng dingkham, He! Poubaomei.",
            "",
            "Ata nduanglou o,",
            "Lunggeih mei muang zingh mei khou rui,",
            "Adaeng khou bam o Poubaomei",
            "Kap bammei nthaek khang.",
            "",
            "2. Guang nimei ram ta ai machunh,",
            "Banchra thanmei nun lunghpui ram;",
            "Lungh rianrana ai kap bam e,",
            "Lungh rianramei muangh ding khou hei.",
            "",
            "3. He! Abumaeng kaap bammei hei,",
            "Kandih khou hei nthaek kei the;",
            "Ngumzaina kumna samni the,",
            "Ringsuang mei bam tingkauh ram thang.",
            "",
            "4. Khou tei rianrana kap bammei,",
            "Makge Kanaan ramgaimei khou;",
            "Kalloumei Pu nduanghou o,",
            "Theihmei duipaeng ram gaimei khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
